{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790564756492,"sessionID":"ses_f1a065858ffecI4EzBIBVNcH78","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_sJC5kgaB2nPKYny13HuB87Gn","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/task.md"},"output":"<path>/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/task.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Garden Grant Closeout Recovery\n2: \n3: You are helping recover a partially completed neighborhood garden mini-grant closeout packet.\n4: \n5: The prior analyst left draft work under `prior_work/`. Read the drafts and the local evidence files, then audit what should be preserved, what should be corrected, and what is missing.\n6: \n7: Create the deliverables listed in `output_contract.md` inside an `answer/` folder in this task folder. The goal is to leave behind a reviewable closeout packet that keeps correct prior progress instead of starting over unnecessarily.\n8: \n9: Use local files only.\n\n(End of file - total 9 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Garden Grant Closeout Recovery\n\nYou are helping recover a partially completed neighborhood garden mini-grant closeout packet.\n\nThe prior analyst left draft work under `prior_work/`. Read the drafts and the local evidence files, then audit what should be preserved, what should be corrected, and what is missing.\n\nCreate the deliverables listed in `output_contract.md` inside an `answer/` folder in this task folder. The goal is to leave behind a reviewable closeout packet that keeps correct prior progress instead of starting over unnecessarily.\n\nUse local files only.","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/task.md","text":"# Garden Grant Closeout Recovery\n\nYou are helping recover a partially completed neighborhood garden mini-grant closeout packet.\n\nThe prior analyst left draft work under `prior_work/`. Read the drafts and the local evidence files, then audit what should be preserved, what should be corrected, and what is missing.\n\nCreate the deliverables listed in `output_contract.md` inside an `answer/` folder in this task folder. The goal is to leave behind a reviewable closeout packet that keeps correct prior progress instead of starting over unnecessarily.\n\nUse local files only.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":9,"totalLines":9,"truncated":false}},"title":"tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/task.md","time":{"start":1790564756418,"end":1790564756482}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_05a5f64ea8895be1016ab9d994484c87d286dc8f06981edff5"}},"id":"prt_0e5f9ebb4001utsw2r2D7QH0lU","sessionID":"ses_f1a065858ffecI4EzBIBVNcH78","messageID":"msg_0e5f9c926001BNINUH3gsoP5XT"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790564756492,"sessionID":"ses_f1a065858ffecI4EzBIBVNcH78","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_WpxIZufdIrAB5riurdUGwIcF","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/output_contract.md"},"output":"<path>/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/output_contract.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Deliverable Contract\n2: \n3: Create an `answer/` folder in this task folder, then create these three files inside it. Markdown tables or concise labeled sections are fine, but the paths, filenames, and required facts must be present.\n4: \n5: ## `answer/audit_findings.md`\n6: \n7: Audit the prior work before presenting corrected decisions.\n8: \n9: Required facts:\n10: \n11: - Which prior facts or decisions should be preserved.\n12: - Which prior facts or decisions should be corrected.\n13: - Which expense, if any, was omitted from the prior draft.\n14: - Which award cap source controls and why.\n15: - Local evidence file names supporting preservation and correction decisions.\n16: \n17: ## `answer/corrected_expense_decisions.md`\n18: \n19: Write the corrected expense decision table.\n20: \n21: Required facts:\n22: \n23: - One row or entry for every expense ID in `04_expenses.csv`.\n24: - For each expense: requested amount, approved amount, approve/reject/partial decision, and reason.\n25: - The volunteer refreshments cap when applied.\n26: - The receipt rule when applied.\n27: - The corrected reimbursable total.\n28: \n29: ## `answer/final_closeout_summary.md`\n30: \n31: Write the final closeout summary for the program manager.\n32: \n33: Required facts:\n34: \n35: - Correct award cap and source.\n36: - Correct reimbursable total.\n37: - Remaining amount under the cap.\n38: - Preserved useful prior work.\n39: - Corrected wrong prior work.\n40: - Outcome facts from the local outcome note.\n41: \n42: Rules:\n43: \n44: - Use local files only.\n45: - Do not put the required deliverables in the task root; put them under `answer/`.\n46: - Preserve correct prior work when it is supported by the current local evidence.\n47: - Extra scratch files are allowed, but the three named deliverables under `answer/` are the review packet.\n\n(End of file - total 47 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Deliverable Contract\n\nCreate an `answer/` folder in this task folder, then create these three files inside it. Markdown tables or concise labeled sections are fine, but the paths, filenames, and required facts must be present.\n\n## `answer/audit_findings.md`\n\nAudit the prior work before presenting corrected decisions.\n\nRequired facts:\n\n- Which prior facts or decisions should be preserved.\n- Which prior facts or decisions should be corrected.\n- Which expense, if any, was omitted from the prior draft.\n- Which award cap source controls and why.\n- Local evidence file names supporting preservation and correction decisions.\n\n## `answer/corrected_expense_decisions.md`\n\nWrite the corrected expense decision table.\n","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/output_contract.md","text":"# Deliverable Contract\n\nCreate an `answer/` folder in this task folder, then create these three files inside it. Markdown tables or concise labeled sections are fine, but the paths, filenames, and required facts must be present.\n\n## `answer/audit_findings.md`\n\nAudit the prior work before presenting corrected decisions.\n\nRequired facts:\n\n- Which prior facts or decisions should be preserved.\n- Which prior facts or decisions should be corrected.\n- Which expense, if any, was omitted from the prior draft.\n- Which award cap source controls and why.\n- Local evidence file names supporting preservation and correction decisions.\n\n## `answer/corrected_expense_decisions.md`\n\nWrite the corrected expense decision table.\n\nRequired facts:\n\n- One row or entry for every expense ID in `04_expenses.csv`.\n- For each expense: requested amount, approved amount, approve/reject/partial decision, and reason.\n- The volunteer refreshments cap when applied.\n- The receipt rule when applied.\n- The corrected reimbursable total.\n\n## `answer/final_closeout_summary.md`\n\nWrite the final closeout summary for the program manager.\n\nRequired facts:\n\n- Correct award cap and source.\n- Correct reimbursable total.\n- Remaining amount under the cap.\n- Preserved useful prior work.\n- Corrected wrong prior work.\n- Outcome facts from the local outcome note.\n\nRules:\n\n- Use local files only.\n- Do not put the required deliverables in the task root; put them under `answer/`.\n- Preserve correct prior work when it is supported by the current local evidence.\n- Extra scratch files are allowed, but the three named deliverables under `answer/` are the review packet.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":47,"totalLines":47,"truncated":false}},"title":"tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/output_contract.md","time":{"start":1790564756425,"end":1790564756483}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_05a5f64ea8895be1016ab9d994485887d293cfdc2acb491606"}},"id":"prt_0e5f9ebc5001yQ45phCyNbLjvp","sessionID":"ses_f1a065858ffecI4EzBIBVNcH78","messageID":"msg_0e5f9c926001BNINUH3gsoP5XT"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790564756492,"sessionID":"ses_f1a065858ffecI4EzBIBVNcH78","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_OcXeo19gavhMBiVqj5AG4fVT","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/00_closeout_request.md"},"output":"<path>/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/00_closeout_request.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Closeout Request\n2: \n3: Request date: 2026-05-24\n4: \n5: The neighborhood garden mini-grant needs a corrected closeout packet for finance review.\n6: \n7: The prior analyst already drafted expense decisions and a short summary in `prior_work/`. Some of that work is useful, but some of it used stale award information or missed current reimbursement rules.\n8: \n9: Use the newest dated award document when award-cap sources conflict. Preserve correct decisions and outcome facts instead of rewriting the packet from scratch.\n\n(End of file - total 9 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Closeout Request\n\nRequest date: 2026-05-24\n\nThe neighborhood garden mini-grant needs a corrected closeout packet for finance review.\n\nThe prior analyst already drafted expense decisions and a short summary in `prior_work/`. Some of that work is useful, but some of it used stale award information or missed current reimbursement rules.\n\nUse the newest dated award document when award-cap sources conflict. Preserve correct decisions and outcome facts instead of rewriting the packet from scratch.","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/00_closeout_request.md","text":"# Closeout Request\n\nRequest date: 2026-05-24\n\nThe neighborhood garden mini-grant needs a corrected closeout packet for finance review.\n\nThe prior analyst already drafted expense decisions and a short summary in `prior_work/`. Some of that work is useful, but some of it used stale award information or missed current reimbursement rules.\n\nUse the newest dated award document when award-cap sources conflict. Preserve correct decisions and outcome facts instead of rewriting the packet from scratch.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":9,"totalLines":9,"truncated":false}},"title":"tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/00_closeout_request.md","time":{"start":1790564756430,"end":1790564756484}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_05a5f64ea8895be1016ab9d994486087d2a067b81afadfb927"}},"id":"prt_0e5f9ebca001rA87z4dz48QDnu","sessionID":"ses_f1a065858ffecI4EzBIBVNcH78","messageID":"msg_0e5f9c926001BNINUH3gsoP5XT"}}
