{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790564756499,"sessionID":"ses_f1a065858ffecI4EzBIBVNcH78","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_S5yAyExOUUzAHC4X4PCobJFb","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md"},"output":"<path>/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Draft Closeout Summary\n2: \n3: Prior analyst draft, created 2026-05-21.\n4: \n5: The draft uses the original `$2,000.00` award cap from the 2026-04-15 award letter.\n6: \n7: Draft reimbursement request: `$1,855.00`.\n8: \n9: Draft remaining amount under cap: `$145.00`.\n10: \n11: Outcome facts already captured:\n12: \n13: - 140 seedling starter kits were distributed.\n14: - 36 Braille outreach flyers were printed for accessible pickup locations.\n15: \n16: The draft did not include a decision for final report postage.\n\n(End of file - total 16 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Draft Closeout Summary\n\nPrior analyst draft, created 2026-05-21.\n\nThe draft uses the original `$2,000.00` award cap from the 2026-04-15 award letter.\n\nDraft reimbursement request: `$1,855.00`.\n\nDraft remaining amount under cap: `$145.00`.\n\nOutcome facts already captured:\n\n- 140 seedling starter kits were distributed.\n- 36 Braille outreach flyers were printed for accessible pickup locations.\n\nThe draft did not include a decision for final report postage.","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md","text":"# Draft Closeout Summary\n\nPrior analyst draft, created 2026-05-21.\n\nThe draft uses the original `$2,000.00` award cap from the 2026-04-15 award letter.\n\nDraft reimbursement request: `$1,855.00`.\n\nDraft remaining amount under cap: `$145.00`.\n\nOutcome facts already captured:\n\n- 140 seedling starter kits were distributed.\n- 36 Braille outreach flyers were printed for accessible pickup locations.\n\nThe draft did not include a decision for final report postage.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":16,"totalLines":16,"truncated":false}},"title":"tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md","time":{"start":1790564756463,"end":1790564756498}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_05a5f64ea8895be1016ab9d994489087d29f5d771ead4b4dd9"}},"id":"prt_0e5f9ebed001sLmWkwPqja5lGy","sessionID":"ses_f1a065858ffecI4EzBIBVNcH78","messageID":"msg_0e5f9c926001BNINUH3gsoP5XT"}}
