{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790564792087,"sessionID":"ses_f1a065858ffecI4EzBIBVNcH78","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_OJXtxcAaQytw7L8TyJiu68hT","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/audit_findings.md\n+# Audit Findings\n+\n+## Preserve\n+\n+- **G-001 ($980.00): approve.** Garden supplies are eligible, and the receipt is on file (`04_expenses.csv`; `01_allowability_rules.md`).\n+- **G-003 ($420.00): approve.** Accessibility printing is eligible, and the receipt is on file (`04_expenses.csv`; `01_allowability_rules.md`).\n+- **G-004 ($0.00): reject.** Staff gifts are explicitly ineligible (`04_expenses.csv`; `01_allowability_rules.md`).\n+- Preserve the outcomes already recorded in the draft: 140 seedling starter kits distributed and 36 Braille outreach flyers printed (`prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md`; confirmed by `05_outcomes.md`).\n+\n+## Correct\n+\n+- **G-002:** The draft approved all $145.00. Volunteer refreshments are eligible only up to **$120.00** for this event, so approve $120.00 and disallow $25.00 (`prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`; `04_expenses.csv`; `01_allowability_rules.md`).\n+- **G-005:** The draft approved $310.00 despite no receipt. A receipt is required for a single expense over $75.00; the ledger note says the poster invoice is missing. The current rules do not list general public outreach printing as eligible either. Reject $310.00 (`prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`; `04_expenses.csv`; `01_allowability_rules.md`).\n+- **Award cap and summary math:** The draft used the original $2,000.00 cap and calculated $145.00 remaining against it. The newer 2026-05-22 award update sets the controlling closeout cap at **$1,600.00**, superseding the 2026-04-15 letter. Use the update because the source-reliability rule requires the newest dated award document (`prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md`; `02_award_letter_2026-04-15.md`; `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`; `01_allowability_rules.md`).\n+\n+## Omission and corrected total\n+\n+- **G-006 ($68.00 final report postage) was omitted** from the prior expense table and summary. Approve it: public outreach postage is eligible, and expenses of $75.00 or less may be approved without a receipt when the ledger has a note; this row has the note “postal ledger entry under receipt threshold” (`prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`; `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md`; `04_expenses.csv`; `01_allowability_rules.md`).\n+- Corrected reimbursable total: **$1,588.00** ($980.00 + $120.00 + $420.00 + $68.00). Against the controlling $1,600.00 cap, **$12.00 remains**.\n+\n+The preserved draft work is the supported decisions for G-001, G-003, and G-004 and the two accurate outcome facts. The unsupported full approvals for G-002 and G-005, stale cap, derived remaining amount, and missing G-006 decision are corrected in the accompanying deliverables.\n*** Add File: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/corrected_expense_decisions.md\n+# Corrected Expense Decisions\n+\n+| Expense ID | Requested | Approved | Decision | Reason |\n+| --- | ---: | ---: | --- | --- |\n+| G-001 | $980.00 | $980.00 | Approve | Garden supplies are eligible; receipt is on file. |\n+| G-002 | $145.00 | $120.00 | Partial | Volunteer refreshments are eligible up to the $120.00 event cap; $25.00 is over the cap. Receipt is on file. |\n+| G-003 | $420.00 | $420.00 | Approve | Accessibility printing is eligible; receipt is on file. |\n+| G-004 | $160.00 | $0.00 | Reject | Staff gifts are not eligible. |\n+| G-005 | $310.00 | $0.00 | Reject | No receipt is on file for this $310.00 expense, exceeding the $75.00 receipt threshold. General public outreach printing is not among the categories listed as eligible in the current rules. |\n+| G-006 | $68.00 | $68.00 | Approve | Public outreach postage is eligible. At $75.00 or less, no receipt is required when the ledger includes a note; this row has a ledger note. |\n+\n+**Corrected reimbursable total: $1,588.00.** This is below the controlling $1,600.00 award cap by $12.00. The refreshments cap applied is $120.00. Receipt rule applied: a receipt is required for any single expense over $75.00; expenses of $75.00 or less may be approved without a receipt when the ledger includes a note.\n*** Add File: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/final_closeout_summary.md\n+# Final Closeout Summary\n+\n+The controlling reimbursement cap is **$1,600.00**, set by the 2026-05-22 award update (`03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`), which supersedes the original $2,000.00 cap in the 2026-04-15 award letter (`02_award_letter_2026-04-15.md`).\n+\n+The corrected reimbursable total is **$1,588.00**, leaving **$12.00** under the cap.\n+\n+Useful prior work preserved: the supported decisions to approve garden supplies (G-001) and accessibility printing (G-003), reject staff gifts (G-004), and the recorded outcomes of 140 seedling starter kits distributed and 36 Braille outreach flyers printed for accessible pickup locations.\n+\n+Prior work corrected: G-002 refreshments are capped at $120.00 rather than the requested $145.00; G-005 is rejected because its $310.00 expense has no receipt despite the over-$75.00 receipt requirement and general public outreach printing is not listed as eligible; and the draft's use of the superseded $2,000.00 cap and its $145.00 remaining calculation are replaced. The omitted G-006 final report postage expense ($68.00) is approved under the eligible postage rule and ledger-note exception to the receipt requirement.\n+\n+Program outcomes (`05_outcomes.md`): **140** seedling starter kits were distributed; **36** Braille outreach flyers were printed for accessible pickup locations; and **18** volunteer setup shifts were completed.\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/audit_findings.md\nA tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/corrected_expense_decisions.md\nA tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/final_closeout_summary.md","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/audit_findings.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/audit_findings.md\n+++ /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/audit_findings.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@\n+# Audit Findings\n+\n+## Preserve\n+\n+- **G-001 ($980.00): approve.** Garden supplies are eligible, and the receipt is on file (`04_expenses.csv`; `01_allowability_rules.md`).\n+- **G-003 ($420.00): approve.** Accessibility printing is eligible, and the receipt is on file (`04_expenses.csv`; `01_allowability_rules.md`).\n+- **G-004 ($0.00): reject.** Staff gifts are explicitly ineligible (`04_expenses.csv`; `01_allowability_rules.md`).\n+- Preserve the outcomes already recorded in the draft: 140 seedling starter kits distributed and 36 Braille outreach flyers printed (`prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md`; confirmed by `05_outcomes.md`).\n+\n+## Correct\n+\n+- **G-002:** The draft approved all $145.00. Volunteer refreshments are eligible only up to **$120.00** for this event, so approve $120.00 and disallow $25.00 (`prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`; `04_expenses.csv`; `01_allowability_rules.md`).\n+- **G-005:** The draft approved $310.00 despite no receipt. A receipt is required for a single expense over $75.00; the ledger note says the poster invoice is missing. The current rules do not list general public outreach printing as eligible either. Reject $310.00 (`prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`; `04_expenses.csv`; `01_allowability_rules.md`).\n+- **Award cap and summary math:** The draft used the original $2,000.00 cap and calculated $145.00 remaining against it. The newer 2026-05-22 award update sets the controlling closeout cap at **$1,600.00**, superseding the 2026-04-15 letter. Use the update because the source-reliability rule requires the newest dated award document (`prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md`; `02_award_letter_2026-04-15.md`; `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`; `01_allowability_rules.md`).\n+\n+## Omission and corrected total\n+\n+- **G-006 ($68.00 final report postage) was omitted** from the prior expense table and summary. Approve it: public outreach postage is eligible, and expenses of $75.00 or less may be approved without a receipt when the ledger has a note; this row has the note “postal ledger entry under receipt threshold” (`prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`; `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md`; `04_expenses.csv`; `01_allowability_rules.md`).\n+- Corrected reimbursable total: **$1,588.00** ($980.00 + $120.00 + $420.00 + $68.00). Against the controlling $1,600.00 cap, **$12.00 remains**.\n+\n+The preserved draft work is the supported decisions for G-001, G-003, and G-004 and the two accurate outcome facts. The unsupported full approvals for G-002 and G-005, stale cap, derived remaining amount, and missing G-006 decision are corrected in the accompanying deliverables.\n\nIndex: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/corrected_expense_decisions.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/corrected_expense_decisions.md\n+++ /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/corrected_expense_decisions.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@\n+# Corrected Expense Decisions\n+\n+| Expense ID | Requested | Approved | Decision | Reason |\n+| --- | ---: | ---: | --- | --- |\n+| G-001 | $980.00 | $980.00 | Approve | Garden supplies are eligible; receipt is on file. |\n+| G-002 | $145.00 | $120.00 | Partial | Volunteer refreshments are eligible up to the $120.00 event cap; $25.00 is over the cap. Receipt is on file. |\n+| G-003 | $420.00 | $420.00 | Approve | Accessibility printing is eligible; receipt is on file. |\n+| G-004 | $160.00 | $0.00 | Reject | Staff gifts are not eligible. |\n+| G-005 | $310.00 | $0.00 | Reject | No receipt is on file for this $310.00 expense, exceeding the $75.00 receipt threshold. General public outreach printing is not among the categories listed as eligible in the current rules. |\n+| G-006 | $68.00 | $68.00 | Approve | Public outreach postage is eligible. At $75.00 or less, no receipt is required when the ledger includes a note; this row has a ledger note. |\n+\n+**Corrected reimbursable total: $1,588.00.** This is below the controlling $1,600.00 award cap by $12.00. The refreshments cap applied is $120.00. Receipt rule applied: a receipt is required for any single expense over $75.00; expenses of $75.00 or less may be approved without a receipt when the ledger includes a note.\n\nIndex: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/final_closeout_summary.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/final_closeout_summary.md\n+++ /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/final_closeout_summary.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@\n+# Final Closeout Summary\n+\n+The controlling reimbursement cap is **$1,600.00**, set by the 2026-05-22 award update (`03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`), which supersedes the original $2,000.00 cap in the 2026-04-15 award letter (`02_award_letter_2026-04-15.md`).\n+\n+The corrected reimbursable total is **$1,588.00**, leaving **$12.00** under the cap.\n+\n+Useful prior work preserved: the supported decisions to approve garden supplies (G-001) and accessibility printing (G-003), reject staff gifts (G-004), and the recorded outcomes of 140 seedling starter kits distributed and 36 Braille outreach flyers printed for accessible pickup locations.\n+\n+Prior work corrected: G-002 refreshments are capped at $120.00 rather than the requested $145.00; G-005 is rejected because its $310.00 expense has no receipt despite the over-$75.00 receipt requirement and general public outreach printing is not listed as eligible; and the draft's use of the superseded $2,000.00 cap and its $145.00 remaining calculation are replaced. The omitted G-006 final report postage expense ($68.00) is approved under the eligible postage rule and ledger-note exception to the receipt requirement.\n+\n+Program outcomes (`05_outcomes.md`): **140** seedling starter kits were distributed; **36** Braille outreach flyers were printed for accessible pickup locations; and **18** volunteer setup shifts were completed.\n\n","files":[{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/audit_findings.md","relativePath":"tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/audit_findings.md","type":"add","patch":"Index: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/audit_findings.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/audit_findings.md\n+++ /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/audit_findings.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@\n+# Audit Findings\n+\n+## Preserve\n+\n+- **G-001 ($980.00): approve.** Garden supplies are eligible, and the receipt is on file (`04_expenses.csv`; `01_allowability_rules.md`).\n+- **G-003 ($420.00): approve.** Accessibility printing is eligible, and the receipt is on file (`04_expenses.csv`; `01_allowability_rules.md`).\n+- **G-004 ($0.00): reject.** Staff gifts are explicitly ineligible (`04_expenses.csv`; `01_allowability_rules.md`).\n+- Preserve the outcomes already recorded in the draft: 140 seedling starter kits distributed and 36 Braille outreach flyers printed (`prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md`; confirmed by `05_outcomes.md`).\n+\n+## Correct\n+\n+- *