or this event, so approve $120.00 and disallow $25.00 (`prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`; `04_expenses.csv`; `01_allowability_rules.md`).\n- **G-005:** The draft approved $310.00 despite no receipt. A receipt is required for a single expense over $75.00; the ledger note says the poster invoice is missing. The current rules do not list general public outreach printing as eligible either. Reject $310.00 (`prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`; `04_expenses.csv`; `01_allowability_rules.md`).\n- **Award cap and summary math:** The draft used the original $2,000.00 cap and calculated $145.00 remaining against it. The newer 2026-05-22 award update sets the controlling closeout cap at **$1,600.00**, superseding the 2026-04-15 letter. Use the update because the source-reliability rule requires the newest dated award document (`prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md`; `02_award_letter_2026-04-15.md`; `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`; `01_allowability_rules.md`).\n\n## Omission and corrected total\n\n- **G-006 ($68.00 final report postage) was omitted** from the prior expense table and summary. Approve it: public outreach postage is eligible, and expenses of $75.00 or less may be approved without a receipt when the ledger has a note; this row has the note “postal ledger entry under receipt threshold” (`prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`; `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md`; `04_expenses.csv`; `01_allowability_rules.md`).\n- Corrected reimbursable total: **$1,588.00** ($980.00 + $120.00 + $420.00 + $68.00). Against the controlling $1,600.00 cap, **$12.00 remains**.\n","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/audit_findings.md","text":"# Audit Findings\n\n## Preserve\n\n- **G-001 ($980.00): approve.** Garden supplies are eligible, and the receipt is on file (`04_expenses.csv`; `01_allowability_rules.md`).\n- **G-003 ($420.00): approve.** Accessibility printing is eligible, and the receipt is on file (`04_expenses.csv`; `01_allowability_rules.md`).\n- **G-004 ($0.00): reject.** Staff gifts are explicitly ineligible (`04_expenses.csv`; `01_allowability_rules.md`).\n- Preserve the outcomes already recorded in the draft: 140 seedling starter kits distributed and 36 Braille outreach flyers printed (`prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md`; confirmed by `05_outcomes.md`).\n\n## Correct\n\n- **G-002:** The draft approved all $145.00. Volunteer refreshments are eligible only up to **$120.00** for this event, so approve $120.00 and disallow $25.00 (`prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`; `04_expenses.csv`; `01_allowability_rules.md`).\n- **G-005:** The draft approved $310.00 despite no receipt. A receipt is required for a single expense over $75.00; the ledger note says the poster invoice is missing. The current rules do not list general public outreach printing as eligible either. Reject $310.00 (`prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`; `04_expenses.csv`; `01_allowability_rules.md`).\n- **Award cap and summary math:** The draft used the original $2,000.00 cap and calculated $145.00 remaining against it. The newer 2026-05-22 award update sets the controlling closeout cap at **$1,600.00**, superseding the 2026-04-15 letter. Use the update because the source-reliability rule requires the newest dated award document (`prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md`; `02_award_letter_2026-04-15.md`; `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`; `01_allowability_rules.md`).\n\n## Omission and corrected total\n\n- **G-006 ($68.00 final report postage) was omitted** from the prior expense table and summary. Approve it: public outreach postage is eligible, and expenses of $75.00 or less may be approved without a receipt when the ledger has a note; this row has the note “postal ledger entry under receipt threshold” (`prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`; `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md`; `04_expenses.csv`; `01_allowability_rules.md`).\n- Corrected reimbursable total: **$1,588.00** ($980.00 + $120.00 + $420.00 + $68.00). Against the controlling $1,600.00 cap, **$12.00 remains**.\n\nThe preserved draft work is the supported decisions for G-001, G-003, and G-004 and the two accurate outcome facts. The unsupported full approvals for G-002 and G-005, stale cap, derived remaining amount, and missing G-006 decision are corrected in the accompanying deliverables.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":21,"totalLines":21,"truncated":false}},"title":"tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/audit_findings.md","time":{"start":1790564800224,"end":1790564800244}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0dd55da6b44e073d016ab9d9c00d3087d28a72bb93df75d2ba"}},"id":"prt_0e5fa96ab001SW26zsP6tmFn2d","sessionID":"ses_f1a065858ffecI4EzBIBVNcH78","messageID":"msg_0e5fa84e6001PVjTUj2hEFMPjq"}}
